// "Mournful keening... wide aura, gnawed by sorrowful energy" -- a
// lingering damage zone, so this deviates from the sheet's stated
// `GroundAoe` to `StaticAura`, same reasoning conjuration/entangle.ron
// already documents (GroundAoe fires once at cast; only StaticAura leaves
// a real reapplying zone behind). `BuffKind::Burning` reused as a
// damage-type-agnostic damage-over-time primitive (its own `HealthChange
// OverTime` effect has no elemental gate), same reuse
// transmutation/heat_metal.ron already made for non-fire DoT. Sheet's
// secondary "cannot regain HP" rider dropped -- no heal-block `BuffEffect`
// exists anywhere in the engine (same class of drop as N76-I's
// chill_touch anti-healing rider).
//
// Reviewer correction: `Burning` resolves as `HealthChangeOverTime { rate:
// -strength, tick_dur: Secs(0.25) }` (DPS = strength * 4), so an earlier
// per-application `duration: Some(60)` on a strength-6.0 burn meant one
// graze alone dealt ~1440 damage over the aura's own 60s lifetime -- ~12x
// the shipped precedent conjuration/flaming_sphere.ron sets for the same
// StaticAura+Burning shape (`duration: Some(2)`, a short per-tick burn
// refreshed by standing in the zone, not a single catastrophic
// application). Matched to that precedent's duration instead.
StaticAura(
    buildup_duration: 0.6,
    cast_duration: 0.5,
    recover_duration: 0.4,
    energy_cost: 70.0,
    targets: OutOfGroup,
    auras: [
        (kind: Burning, strength: 6.0, duration: Some(3), category: Some(Magical)),
    ],
    aura_duration: Some(60.0),
    range: 6.0,
    sprite_info: None,
    meta: (
        school: Some(Enchantment),
        source: Some(Arcane),
        // level 6 spell -> min_level 36, the level * 6 convention.
        requirements: (min_level: Some(36)),
    ),
)
